{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schema/check.v1.json",
  "id": "testing/testing/no-focused-tests",
  "version": "1.1.3",
  "area": "testing",
  "cardinality": "singleton",
  "dimension": "tests.focus",
  "minSeverity": null,
  "params": {},
  "impl": {
    "kind": "pattern",
    "patterns": {
      "typescript": [
        {
          "id": "focused-or-skipped",
          "utils": {
            "function-like": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "kind": "function_declaration"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "generator_function_declaration"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "function_expression"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "generator_function"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "arrow_function"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "method_definition"
                }
              ]
            },
            "scope": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "kind": "program"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "statement_block"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "switch_body"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "for_statement"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "for_in_statement"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "catch_clause"
                },
                {
                  "matches": "function-like"
                }
              ]
            },
            "boundary": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "matches": "scope"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "ambient_declaration"
                }
              ]
            },
            "destructuring": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "kind": "object_pattern"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "array_pattern"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "pair_pattern"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "object_assignment_pattern"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "assignment_pattern"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "rest_pattern"
                }
              ]
            },
            "not-a-default": {
              "not": {
                "inside": {
                  "field": "right",
                  "any": [
                    {
                      "kind": "assignment_pattern"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "object_assignment_pattern"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "binding-slot": {
              "all": [
                {
                  "matches": "not-a-default"
                },
                {
                  "any": [
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "stopBy": {
                          "not": {
                            "matches": "destructuring"
                          }
                        },
                        "field": "name",
                        "any": [
                          {
                            "kind": "variable_declarator"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "function_declaration"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "generator_function_declaration"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "function_expression"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "generator_function"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "class_declaration"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "abstract_class_declaration"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "enum_declaration",
                            "not": {
                              "has": {
                                "regex": "^const$"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "stopBy": {
                          "not": {
                            "matches": "destructuring"
                          }
                        },
                        "field": "pattern",
                        "any": [
                          {
                            "kind": "required_parameter"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "optional_parameter"
                          }
                        ],
                        "inside": {
                          "kind": "formal_parameters",
                          "inside": {
                            "field": "parameters",
                            "matches": "function-like"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "stopBy": {
                          "not": {
                            "matches": "destructuring"
                          }
                        },
                        "field": "parameter",
                        "any": [
                          {
                            "kind": "arrow_function"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "catch_clause"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "stopBy": {
                          "not": {
                            "matches": "destructuring"
                          }
                        },
                        "field": "left",
                        "kind": "for_in_statement",
                        "has": {
                          "field": "kind",
                          "regex": "^(const|let|var)$"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "declares": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "all": [
                    {
                      "any": [
                        {
                          "kind": "function_declaration"
                        },
                        {
                          "kind": "generator_function_declaration"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "has": {
                        "field": "name",
                        "pattern": "$G"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "all": [
                    {
                      "any": [
                        {
                          "kind": "identifier"
                        },
                        {
                          "kind": "type_identifier"
                        },
                        {
                          "kind": "shorthand_property_identifier_pattern"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "pattern": "$G"
                    },
                    {
                      "matches": "binding-slot"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "not-the-global": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "kind": "identifier",
                  "matches": "not-a-default",
                  "inside": {
                    "stopBy": {
                      "not": {
                        "matches": "destructuring"
                      }
                    },
                    "field": "pattern",
                    "any": [
                      {
                        "kind": "required_parameter"
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "optional_parameter"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "all": [
                    {
                      "any": [
                        {
                          "kind": "identifier"
                        },
                        {
                          "kind": "shorthand_property_identifier"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "pattern": "$G"
                    },
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "stopBy": "end",
                        "matches": "scope",
                        "has": {
                          "stopBy": {
                            "matches": "boundary"
                          },
                          "matches": "declares"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "global-source": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "kind": "identifier",
                  "regex": "^(globalThis|window|global|self)$",
                  "not": {
                    "matches": "not-the-global"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "call_expression",
                  "regex": "^(require|import)\\s*\\(\\s*[\"'`][^.\"'`]"
                }
              ]
            },
            "reaches-global": {
              "any": [
                {
                  "matches": "global-source"
                },
                {
                  "any": [
                    {
                      "kind": "parenthesized_expression"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "await_expression"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "as_expression"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "satisfies_expression"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "non_null_expression"
                    }
                  ],
                  "has": {
                    "stopBy": {
                      "not": {
                        "any": [
                          {
                            "kind": "parenthesized_expression"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "await_expression"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "as_expression"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "satisfies_expression"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "non_null_expression"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "matches": "global-source"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "runtime-ref": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "identifier" },
                { "kind": "member_expression" },
                { "kind": "call_expression" },
                { "kind": "await_expression" }
              ]
            },
            "cond-wrapper": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "parenthesized_expression" },
                { "kind": "as_expression" },
                { "kind": "satisfies_expression" },
                { "kind": "non_null_expression" },
                { "kind": "unary_expression", "has": { "field": "operator", "regex": "^!$" } }
              ]
            },
            "truthy-value": {
              "any": [
                { "kind": "string" },
                { "kind": "template_string" },
                { "kind": "true" },
                { "kind": "arrow_function" },
                { "kind": "function_expression" },
                { "kind": "generator_function" },
                { "kind": "class" },
                { "kind": "object" },
                { "kind": "array" },
                { "kind": "new_expression" },
                { "kind": "sequence_expression" },
                { "kind": "spread_element" },
                { "kind": "identifier", "regex": "^globalThis$" }
              ]
            },
            "always-truthy": {
              "any": [
                { "matches": "truthy-value" },
                {
                  "matches": "cond-wrapper",
                  "has": {
                    "stopBy": { "not": { "matches": "cond-wrapper" } },
                    "matches": "truthy-value"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "runtime-skip": {
              "all": [
                {
                  "inside": {
                    "stopBy": "end",
                    "any": [
                      { "kind": "arrow_function" },
                      { "kind": "function_expression" },
                      { "kind": "function_declaration" },
                      { "kind": "method_definition" }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "has": {
                    "field": "arguments",
                    "all": [
                      {
                        "has": {
                          "nthChild": { "position": 1, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                          "not": { "matches": "always-truthy" },
                          "any": [
                            { "matches": "runtime-ref" },
                            { "has": { "stopBy": "end", "matches": "runtime-ref" } }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "has": {
                          "nthChild": { "position": 2, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                          "any": [
                            { "kind": "string" },
                            { "kind": "template_string" }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "not": {
                          "has": {
                            "nthChild": { "position": 3, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "guarded-skip": {
              "all": [
                {
                  "inside": {
                    "stopBy": { "kind": "if_statement" },
                    "field": "consequence",
                    "kind": "if_statement",
                    "all": [
                      {
                        "has": {
                          "field": "condition",
                          "all": [
                            { "not": { "matches": "always-truthy" } },
                            {
                              "any": [
                                { "matches": "runtime-ref" },
                                { "has": { "stopBy": "end", "matches": "runtime-ref" } }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "inside": {
                          "stopBy": "end",
                          "any": [
                            { "kind": "arrow_function" },
                            { "kind": "function_expression" },
                            { "kind": "function_declaration" },
                            { "kind": "method_definition" }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "any": [
                    {
                      "has": {
                        "field": "arguments",
                        "not": {
                          "has": {
                            "nthChild": { "position": 1, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "has": {
                        "field": "arguments",
                        "all": [
                          {
                            "has": {
                              "nthChild": { "position": 1, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                              "kind": "true"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "has": {
                              "nthChild": { "position": 2, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } },
                              "any": [
                                { "kind": "string" },
                                { "kind": "template_string" }
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "not": {
                              "has": {
                                "nthChild": { "position": 3, "ofRule": { "not": { "kind": "comment" } } }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "focus-key": {
              "has": {
                "stopBy": "end",
                "any": [
                  {
                    "kind": "shorthand_property_identifier_pattern"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "property_identifier"
                  }
                ],
                "regex": "^(fit|fdescribe|xit|xdescribe|xtest)$"
              }
            }
          },
          "rule": {
            "any": [
              {
                "kind": "member_expression",
                "regex": "^(describe|it|test|context|suite)\\b",
                "has": {
                  "field": "property",
                  "regex": "^(only|skip)$"
                },
                "not": {
                  "all": [
                    {
                      "regex": "^test\\.skip$"
                    },
                    {
                      "inside": {
                        "field": "function",
                        "kind": "call_expression",
                        "any": [
                          { "matches": "runtime-skip" },
                          { "matches": "guarded-skip" }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "kind": "subscript_expression",
                "regex": "^(describe|it|test|context|suite)\\b",
                "has": {
                  "field": "index",
                  "regex": "^[\"'`](only|skip)[\"'`]$"
                }
              },
              {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "any": [
                      {
                        "kind": "identifier"
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "shorthand_property_identifier"
                      }
                    ],
                    "regex": "^(fit|fdescribe|xit|xdescribe|xtest)$"
                  },
                  {
                    "not": {
                      "matches": "not-the-global"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "member_expression",
                "all": [
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "property",
                      "regex": "^(fit|fdescribe|xit|xdescribe|xtest)$"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "object",
                      "matches": "reaches-global"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "subscript_expression",
                "all": [
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "index",
                      "regex": "^[\"'`](fit|fdescribe|xit|xdescribe|xtest)[\"'`]$"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "object",
                      "matches": "reaches-global"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "variable_declarator",
                "all": [
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "value",
                      "matches": "reaches-global"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "name",
                      "kind": "object_pattern",
                      "matches": "focus-key"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "assignment_expression",
                "all": [
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "right",
                      "matches": "reaches-global"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "left",
                      "kind": "object_pattern",
                      "matches": "focus-key"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "variable_declarator",
                "all": [
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "value",
                      "regex": "^(describe|it|test|context|suite)\\b"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "has": {
                      "field": "name",
                      "kind": "object_pattern",
                      "has": {
                        "stopBy": "end",
                        "any": [
                          {
                            "kind": "shorthand_property_identifier_pattern"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "property_identifier"
                          }
                        ],
                        "regex": "^(only|skip)$"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "x-note": "A reference is enough, not only a call: const focus = it.only and const { only } = it focus as well. The modifier may sit anywhere in the chain (it.concurrent.only). The Jasmine globals fit, fdescribe, xit, xdescribe and xtest count wherever they are referenced, except where the file binds the name itself: not-the-global is the scope walk of architecture/effects/no-clock-random-env (a parameter, variable, destructured name, function or class, looked for in each enclosing scope), so const fit = button and its uses are a local value, while a fit called in another function or a declare still reach the global. Unlike that check, an import never binds, not even from a relative module: paths reaches only the tests, never the helper that re-exports the global. A binding whose value the file shows to be the global is the global: a read of the name off globalThis, window, global or self, or off require() or import() of a package, by member, bracket or destructuring, counts where it is read. A value laundered through a call or a module the file does not show is out of reach. The one spelling left out is the Playwright runtime skip test.skip(condition, reason) called inside a function (a test body, hook or describe callback): it skips only that test, or that group from a describe callback (accepted: a conditional group skip still runs whenever the condition is false), and focuses nothing. The condition must reach a runtime value (an identifier, member access, call or await somewhere inside it) and must not be always true by its syntax: after unwrapping parentheses, as, satisfies, non-null and ! it is not a string, template, true, function, arrow, generator, class, object, array, new expression, sequence, spread or globalThis. And the reason must be a string or template; no third argument. So test.skip(), test.skip(true, r), test.skip(1, r), test.skip(!0, r), test.skip(title, fn), a top-level test.skip(cond, r), it.skip(...) (Mocha's it.skip(title, x) really skips), every .only, describe.skip and the bracket, alias and destructured forms stay reported. Known gaps: an always-true condition that still names a value (test.skip(true || x, r), test.skip(Boolean(1), r), const S = true; test.skip(S, r)) and Mocha's TDD UI test.skip(titleVar, 'str'), which reads as the Playwright form. Also accepted, inside a test, hook or describe callback: test.skip() and test.skip(true, reason) in the consequence of an if whose condition reads a runtime value and is not always-true. if (true), a skip outside that if, and a top-level if stay reported."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "phase": [
    "pre",
    "stop",
    "commit",
    "ci"
  ],
  "feedback": {
    "message": "{symbol} focuses or skips tests, so the rest of the suite stops running."
  }
}
